1
00:00:03,803 --> 00:00:05,233
- They are not.
- They are too.

2
00:00:05,438 --> 00:00:08,198
(Leonard:)Your hypothesis is completely disconfirmed
by all the data.

3
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:11,208
(Leonard:)You're just clinging to it
out of intellectual stubbornness.

4
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:15,441
(Raj:)No, you're displaying a shocking ignorance
of the subject matter.

5
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:18,742
(Raj:)Mummies and zombies
are the exact same thing.

6
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,440
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah?

7
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,348
(Leonard:)Mummies are wrapped in bandages.

8
00:00:23,556 --> 00:00:26,046
(Raj:)That's called a fashion choice.

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,090
(Leonard:)All right. You brought this on yourself.

10
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:33,200
(Leonard:)- Sheldon, get him.
- Lf a zombie bites you...

11
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,230
(Sheldon:)...you turn into a zombie.

12
00:00:35,435 --> 00:00:37,065
(Sheldon:)However, if a mummy bites you...

13
00:00:37,270 --> 00:00:39,860
(Sheldon:)...all you turn into
is some schmo with a mummy bite.

14
00:00:40,073 --> 00:00:43,533
(Sheldon:)So, like a zombie that's been eaten
from the waist down...

15
00:00:43,743 --> 00:00:46,543
(Sheldon:)...you, sir, have no leg to stand on.

16
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:49,450
- Good boy. Here's a cookie.
- Oh, thank you.

17
00:00:49,649 --> 00:00:51,849
(Howard:)Hey, fellas, what's going on?

18
00:00:52,052 --> 00:00:53,612
(Leonard:)Mummies and zombies again.

19
00:00:53,853 --> 00:00:56,553
Ahh. They're not the same thing.

20
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:58,280
(Leonard:)You get a cookie too.

21
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:00,482
(Howard:)Thanks.

22
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:03,597
(Howard:)Guess who picked up his new car
this morning.

